data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","sequence_number":933,"item_id":"msg_020080674c5f2775016b04477ee34887d1a9597086f29a29aa","output_index":1,"content_index":0,"text":"{\"queries\":[],\"result_json\":\"{\\\"intention\\\":\\\"Eat the remaining berry, share the limited assessment finding, and request the missing physical prerequisites for a real recoverable vine-joining trial.\\\",\\\"steps\\\":[{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"interface\\\":\\\"eat\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"target\\\":\\\"item-60-lin-356\\\",\\\"quantity\\\":1}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":null},{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"interface\\\":\\\"message\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"recipient\\\":\\\"moss\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"My tick-78 vine-and-branch prerequisite assessment completed. It did not establish discrete branch geometry, wrapping, or joint strength; materials were released unchanged. The earlier vine press result likewise is not strength evidence. I am requesting bounded geometry and contact mechanics before attempting a useful joint. No usable joined object has been produced.\\\",\\\"urgency\\\":\\\"ordinary\\\",\\\"subject\\\":\\\"Vine assessment limits\\\"}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":null},{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"interface\\\":\\\"request\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"source-bound-branch-and-vine-geometry-trial\\\",\\\"function\\\":\\\"Provide a bounded physical way to examine actual owned branch and vine inputs for discrete piece identity, usable dimensions and segment selection. If geometry supports it, expose a recoverable wrapping trial with inspection and a separately selected, explicitly measured low-force separation test; otherwise record the specific unresolved prerequisites.\\\",\\\"conditions\\\":\\\"Lin completed the tick-78 geometry-only assessment manual-78-lin-459. Owned inputs are vine item-66-lin-388 quantity 0.9 and branch item-76-lin-448 quantity 2. Quantity and prior vine flexibility do not establish lengths, discrete segments or joint strength. Require real access and a clear worksite; do not infer missing physical properties from labels.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":\\\"Actual owned material identities and explicitly selected portions, after physical geometry assessment. Preserve accounting of unused inputs and any real placed or altered material.\\\",\\\"costs\\\":\\\"Method, duration, energy and any necessary material alteration are unknown. Expose these and cancellation/recovery terms before execution. Personal study must take world time; registration grants no mastery.\\\",\\\"effects\\\":\\\"Dated source-bound measurements and, only after actual paid operations, evidence of wrapping or response to a measured force. Do not create a joint, strength result or practical benefit merely by registration. Preserve partial work and make recovery or safe cancellation explicit.\\\"}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":null}],\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"interrupts\\\":[],\\\"notes\\\":[\\\"Health is 100 and energy is 40 at tick 80; no further recovery is presently needed.\\\",\\\"The completed assessment left no ongoing assembly or placed joining material to recover.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[\\\"Prefer bounded reversible physical trials over repeated geometry-only assessments.\\\",\\\"Review new interface terms and learn any unmastered capability before use.\\\"],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"vine-material-investigation\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"paused\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"What physical properties and joining behavior can locally collected vine and branch inputs actually demonstrate?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"The tick-70 press trial recorded load 0.2, held=false and flexibility=0.9 after consuming 0.1 vine.\\\",\\\"Personal study of recoverable-vine-joining-assessment completed at tick 73.\\\",\\\"The tick-78 paid prerequisite assessment completed; its record says quantity and the prior press response do not establish physical piece geometry or joining strength.\\\",\\\"The assessment performed no wrapping, force application, cutting or recovery and released unused material reservations unchanged.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"Discrete source geometry, usable lengths, segment selection and contact/separation mechanics remain unresolved. No joint performance has been measured.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Obtain bounded physical evidence before considering practical vine use.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Collected vine and branch inputs.\\\",\\\"Completed a low-intensity vine press trial.\\\",\\\"Learned and executed the geometry-only prerequisite assessment.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"Limited dated vine press evidence.\\\",\\\"Personal mastery of the prerequisite assessment.\\\",\\\"Dated assessment record manual-78-lin-459.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"Executable physical geometry assessment and, if feasible, accountable wrapping and measured separation mechanics.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Request the missing source-bound physical operations, then review availability, cost and learning requirements.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"Existing mastered interface cannot perform wrapping or a force test; repeating it would not supply the missing mechanics.\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"The assessment clarified the limits of the available evidence. No practical joining benefit is established.\\\"}]}\"}","logprobs":[]}

